For me Web application is the most important :-
A web application is a software program that runs through a web browser and allows users to perform specific tasks online. 
For example  banking systems, online shopping and railway reservation systems. 
Web applications use technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React , databases, servers, and API.
Caption = Turning ideas into interactive experiences.

2nd most important component :-
User Interface (UI) is the visual part of a website that users interact with. 
It includes buttons,colors, icons, images, layouts, and navigation. 
A good UI makes an application attractive, responsive and easy to use, helping users complete tasks quickly and comfortably.
caption = Where creativity meets what actually works.

User Experience (UX) describes how users feel and interact with a website. 
It focuses on simple navigation, fast responses, clear information, and user satisfaction. 
It ensures  that users can complete their goals comfortably.
caption = A better experience means happier users.

3rd most important component :- 
React is a JavaScript library not a Framework . 
It is mainly used to make a single page application. 
React makes websites fast and responsive.
React uses a Virtual DOM, so it does not refresh the entire webpage every time something changes.
Caption = The page stays, but the UI keeps changing.

React components are functional Components.
A component is basically a small part of a webpage that we can create once and reuse whenever we need it. 
It keeps the UI simple, organized, and easier to manage.
React App is a collection of Components.
Caption = Small pieces that come together to build the whole UI.


JavaScript is a programming language used to make website interactive and dynamic.
It helps a website respond when we click a button, type something, submit a form, or perform an action. 
In short , HTML creates the structure, CSS makes it look good, and JavaScript makes it work.
Caption = The part that makes the website respond.

